          "inventory_expansion_required": false,
          "statement": "For every smooth positive-density material motion satisfying the no-source mass balance, material constancy of density $D_t\\rho=0$ forces spatially uniform density $\\nabla\\rho=0$, and incompressibility $\\operatorname{div}u=0$ forces irrotationality $\\operatorname{curl}u=0$.",
