                "title": "François Golse, The Boltzmann Equation and Its Hydrodynamic Limits",
                "url": "https://www.cmls.polytechnique.fr/perso/golse/Surveys/FGHdBookEvEq.pdf",
                "locator": "§7.1.2, Theorem 7.2, printed pp. 81–82: whole-space R3 L2 density–velocity–temperature acoustic Cauchy problem and wave reconstruction. Acoustic context only;the all-order smooth periodic theorem is proved locally."
              }
